# Vercel Speed Insights Installation Report

## Summary
Successfully installed and configured Vercel Speed Insights for the Next.js 14.1.0 project following the latest official Vercel documentation.

## Changes Made

### 1. Package Installation
- Installed `@vercel/speed-insights` package using npm
- Package version: latest (installed via npm install)
- Updated package.json dependencies
- Updated package-lock.json with new dependency tree

### 2. Code Changes
**Modified: `src/app/layout.jsx`**
- Added import statement: `import { SpeedInsights } from "@vercel/speed-insights/next";`
- Added `<SpeedInsights />` component at the end of the `<body>` tag
- Placement follows Vercel's official documentation for Next.js App Router (13.5+)
- Component added after all existing content (Header, main, Footer, WhatsAppPopup) to avoid any layout disruptions

