## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable Speed Insights on Vercel:
1. Deploy this code to Vercel (via git push or `vercel deploy`)
2. Navigate to the Vercel dashboard
3. Select the project
4. Go to Speed Insights in the sidebar
5. Click "Enable" to activate Speed Insights for the project

Once enabled, Speed Insights will automatically start collecting performance metrics from real user visits.

